From: Erhan Bilgili <erhan.bilgili@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 14:28:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] vulkan/runtime: exclude CPU idle gaps from frame pacing

Measure GPU intervals from before semaphore waits through completion.
Keep timing markers outside waiting batches and handle failed submissions
without waiting for an unsignaled completion.

Generated-by: LLM
